Data Dictionary for Hot Dog Survey Dataset

Dataset Overview: 
This dataset contains survey responses regarding our essential research question: Is A Hot Dog a Sandwich? 
The data was collected through an online survey conducted in 2025. 
 
| Column Name | Description | Data Type | Example Value | 
|-------------|-------------|-----------|---------------|
| Timestamp | Marks the creation of a record with a timestamp. | object | 1/15/2025 13:51:45 |
| Year at UVA | Marks what year you are at the University of Virginia | object | 3rd Year |
| What is your Gender Identity |Inquires about what gender the student identifies with. | object |"Woman"|
| What schools are you apart of? |Establishes what school(s) the participant is enrolled in at UVA. | object |Engineering|
| Is a Hot Dog a Sandwich? | Inquires on respondents' yes/no response to if a hot dog is sandwich. | object | "Yes" |
| How strongly do you feel about your previous answer?	 | Inquires on a scale of 1-5, how prominent the student believes a hot dog is a sandwich.| object |"3"|
|How frequently do you eat hot dogs?	| Inquires on students' amount of hot dog consumption. | object |"Never"|
